  "description": "<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"829\">Stap in de doldwaze strijd tussen flora en fauna met <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"439\">Plants vs. Zombies: Battle for Neighborville – Complete Edition</strong>, een <strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"469\">third-person shooter</strong> vol humor, actie en kleurrijke chaos. Kies uit tientallen unieke personages — elk met eigen wapens en vaardigheden — en strijd in grappige multiplayergevechten of spannende solo-missies.<br data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"659\">Deze <em data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"682\">Complete Edition</em> bevat alle eerder uitgebrachte content, personages en outfits. De cartridge wordt <strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"781\">los geleverd</strong> (zonder hoesje) en verkeert <strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"828\">In Nette Staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"834\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"854\">🎮 Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<li data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"905\">🌻 <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"884\">Third-person shooter</strong> vol humor en actie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"961\">🧟‍♂️ Speel als plant of zombie met unieke krachten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1018\">👥 Online en offline speelbaar, solo of met vrienden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1079\">🎮 <em data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1042\">Complete Edition</em> met alle DLC en content inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1131\">💾 <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1104\">Losse cartridge</strong> – geen hoesje inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1159\">📋 Specificaties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1522\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1173\">Platform:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1193\">Nintendo Switch</strong><br data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1196\"><strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1206\">Titel:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1274\">Plants vs. Zombies: Battle for Neighborville – Complete Edition</strong><br data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1277\"><strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1287\">Genre:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1334\">Third-person shooter / Actie / Multiplayer</strong><br data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1337\"><strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1346\">Taal:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1387\">Meertalig (o.a. Engels & Nederlands)</strong><br data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1390\"><strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1402\">Spelers:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1431\" data-is-only-node=\"\">1–2 lokaal, tot 8 online</strong><br data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\"><strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1447\">Conditie:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1466\">In Nette Staat</strong><br data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1469\"><strong data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1484\">Verpakking:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1520\">Losse cartridge (zonder hoesje)</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1558\"><strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1556\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand</strong></p>",
